{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17682","headline":"夏日苦热同长孙主簿过仁寿寺纳凉 · 杨巨源","name":"夏日苦热同长孙主簿过仁寿寺纳凉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"火入天地罏，南方正何剧。\n四郊长云红，六合太阳赤。\n爀爀沸泉壑，焰焰燋砂石。\n思减祝融权，期匡诸子宅。\n因投竹林寺，一问青莲客。\n心空得清凉，理证等喧寂。\n开襟天籁回，步履雨花积。\n微风动珠帘，惠气入瑶席。\n境闲性方谧，尘远趣皆适。\n淹驾殊未还，朱栏敞虚碧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}